"{\"edits\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":1,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The January 8 business-award option arriving in Bangkok at 4:15 a.m. January 10 may suit you if an earlier arrival is useful. It combines a reported 275,000 Turkish miles with a USD 59 quoted SFO–LAX fare, but award taxes and their scope are unknown. Seat availability and traveler coverage for the points quote are also unreported, and the positioning and award flights are on separate, unverified tickets; confirm availability and whether the connection works for you before booking.\"}]},{\"start\":2,\"end\":3,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"You might choose this later-departing business option over the earlier-arriving business itinerary if a 1:50 p.m. SFO departure and a 39-minute shorter reported elapsed time matter more to you. It arrives 4 hours 35 minutes later, though, and its 186-minute LAX wait is between separate, unverified tickets. The award is still reported at 275,000 Turkish miles, with taxes and seat availability unknown.\"}]}]}"
